OL,3,ASir Patrick Stewart: A life in pictures
OL,4,
OL,5,FLegendary actor Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,6,Frose from humble beginnings in his
OL,7,Fnative Yorkshire to become a global
OL,8,Fsuperstar whose work became
OL,9,Fimmortalised portraying characters on
OL,10,Fsome of the most popular sci-fi
OL,11,Ffranchises in history.
OL,13,FThe star, who won acclaim on both
OL,14,Fstages and screens, died at his home in
OL,15,FLos Angeles on Thursday after a career
OL,16,Fthat spanned more than seven decades.
OL,17,FHe was 86.
OL,19,FSir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,20,F'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,21,Fafter his death at 86
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
